 "emoji": "🚀",
 "sentences": [
  "NASA is hunting for Mars' moon origins.",
  "JAXA’s MMX mission will launch to explore Phobos and Deimos.",
  "Scientists are debating if these moons are captured asteroids or debris from a massive impact.",
  "A special spectrograph called MEGANE will analyze the surface composition.",
  "The spacecraft will collect a Phobos sample in 2028.",
  "Bringing this material to Earth will reveal secrets about our solar system's history."
